config VIDEO_RPI_IMX258
	tristate "Sony IMX258 sensor support (Raspberry Pi driver)"
	depends on I2C && VIDEO_DEV
	depends on MEDIA_CAMERA_SUPPORT
	select MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	select VIDEO_V4L2_SUBDEV_API
	select V4L2_FWNODE
	help
	  Raspberry Pi's driver for the Sony IMX258 sensor (2 or 4 MIPI
	  CSI-2 lanes), with the bus configuration and frame interval calls
	  the Rockchip CSI-2 D-PHY and ISP drivers need.

	  The module is called rpi_imx258.

